msgid "The TDHF and TDKS programs"
msgstr "TDHF 与 TDKS 程序"

msgid ""
"The total propagation time (in au) is set by *t*; *dt* sets the timestep and"
" *ns* the number of steps, where two of the three have to be provided. *ng* "
"sets the number of grid points in one dimension (default = 0) and *grsize* "
"the grid size in bohr (default = 10 bohr). Setting *ng* :math:`>2` switches "
"on the calculation of quantum currents (see below). The option *print* "
"determines the level of output (0=normal output, 1=object linear in "
"matrices, 2=matrices as well, :math:`>2` debug). The subcommand ``PULSE`` "
"determines the envelope used, and takes several options depending on the "
"envelope selected. Possibilities are:"
msgstr ""
"总传播时间（以原子单位计）由 *t* 设置；\\ *dt* 设置时间步长，\\ *ns* 设置步数，这三个参数中必须提供两个。\\ *ng* "
"设置一维中的网格点数量（默认值 = 0），\\ *grsize* 设置以玻尔为单位的网格大小（默认值 = 10 玻尔）。将 *ng* 设置为 "
":math:`>2` 会开启量子电流的计算（见下文）。选项 *print* 决定输出级别（0=正常输出，1=矩阵线性对象，2=同时输出矩阵，\\ "
":math:`>2` 为调试模式）。子命令 ``PULSE`` 确定所使用的包络，并根据所选包络接受多个选项。可能的选项有："

msgid ""
"All runs produce a file *($input).dat* (or *molpro.dat*) which contains "
"time-dependent properties, like the components of the field, components of "
"the dipole moment, total energy, orbital occupation numbers, orbital "
"energies and total number of electrons. The Molpro output file specifies the"
" order of the data in the file. For very long runs the size of the file is "
"restricted by printing only every twentieth set of data."
msgstr ""
"所有运行都会生成一个文件 *($input).dat*\\ （或 *molpro.dat*\\ "
"），其中包含随时间变化的性质，例如场的分量、偶极矩的分量、总能量、轨道占据数、轨道能量和总电子数。Molpro "
"输出文件指定了文件中数据的顺序。对于非常长的运行，文件大小受到限制，仅打印每二十组数据。"

msgid ""
"Quantum currents will be calculated when choosing :math:`ng>2`. A cubic grid"
" will be computed of size *grsize* with a total of :math:`ng^3` gridpoints. "
"The imaginary part of the density will be summed at every timestep and after"
" the dynamics the total current will be evaluated at every gridpoint. The "
"user can extract the required data from this array by printing out parts of "
"it, or by integrating over point, but this requires actual coding, as this "
"has not been implemented sufficiently neat. It is also straightforward to "
"evaluate the currents at every timestep or at selected timesteps. This is "
"not done automatically, because it slows down the dynamics considerably."
msgstr ""
"当选择 :math:`ng>2` 时，将计算量子电流。将计算一个大小为 *grsize* 的立方网格，总共有 :math:`ng^3` "
"个格点。在每个时间步对密度的虚部进行求和，并在动力学计算完成后在每个格点评估总电流。用户可以通过打印部分数组或对点进行积分来提取所需数据，但这需要实际编码，因为此功能尚未实现得足够简洁。在每个时间步或选定的时间步评估电流也很直接。这不会自动完成，因为它会显著减慢动力学计算速度。"
